  "scene_1_prompt": "A shirtless athletic man steps onto wet sand at the shoreline, low-angle tracking shot following his barefoot stride, shallow depth of field isolating his muscular silhouette, warm golden backlight casting a rim glow around his figure, sand grains swirling around his feet, soft bokeh ocean waves in the background",
  "scene_2_prompt": "Smooth dolly-right reveals the sweeping coastline as the athlete turns toward the ocean, medium side shot capturing palm fronds catching amber sunlight, soft haze over the water, horizon line splitting sea and sky, gentle wave rhythm lapping the shore, warm amber and terracotta color grade",
  "scene_3_prompt": "Static wide shot anchored on the horizon positions the athlete as a stark silhouette against a dramatic multicolored sunset sky, dusky orange and violet hues intermixing, lingering mist across the water, subtle glow reflecting off wet sand, waves softly crashing at his feet, high cinematic contrast",
  "scene_4_prompt": "High-angle stationary shot captures the final still frame as the athlete pauses at the waterline, his silhouette framed by a glowing sun sinking below the horizon, rippled sand creating a textured border, warm amber twilight glow, a slight breeze rippling his shorts, sky fading to deep violet"
}

